    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000q4lv](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000q4lv) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Apr 07 2025 53km W of Kampong Haloban. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 2.0488 longitude 96.7892. It impacted 3364 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
